@startuml
title Rust Android Build Pipeline

start

:Resolve script directory;
:Set RUST_LIB_DIR;
:Set JNI_LIBS_PATH;

:Change directory to Rust library;

:Clean previous build;
cargo clean

:Build Rust backend for Android;
cargo ndk build --release

note right
Targets:

* armeabi-v7a
* arm64-v8a
* x86
* x86_64
  end note

:Output shared libraries (.so)
to Flutter jniLibs folder;

:List resulting files;

stop
@enduml
